---
description: Prepare one designImprovements evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: ServiceMechanism[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Propose bounded communication or workflow improvements within approved service authority. Define measurable administrative outcomes, guard against shifting burden to another team, and specify how results would support adoption, revision, or abandonment. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
